#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_ai_contact_livechat.field_im_livechat_channel__woow_ai_handoff_keywords
msgid ""
"Optional. The AI backend decides when the visitor wants a human and hands "
"over by itself (it ends its reply with [[handoff]], or n8n answers "
"\"handoff\": true). Phrases here are an extra pre-filter: a visitor message "
"containing one of them is handed over at once, without calling the backend. "
"Separated by commas or new lines; Latin words match whole words only, case "
"insensitive. Prefer phrases (\"找真人\") over single words (\"客服\"), which also"
" match ordinary questions. Empty (default): the backend decides."
msgstr ""

